---
title: Owner Lead guided workflow — implemented 29 Oct 2026
---
flowchart TD
    N([New / Fresh Owner Lead]) --> C[Call — Initial Qualification]
    C --> Q{Contact result}
    Q -->|No Answer| NA[Increment current and lifetime no-answer counters\nplan next call] --> C
    Q -->|Answered| I{Interested to list?}
    I -->|Not Interested| NI([No commercial action\nmanager may requalify])
    I -->|Interested| L[Owner Lead actions\nAdd Property / Follow-up Call / Explore Meeting]
    L --> AP[Full sectioned Add Property intake\nOwner fixed; Resale Unit created]
    AP --> PM{Pricing method}
    PM -->|Owner Price| DP[Unit: Documents Pending\nnext: Listing Documents]
    PM -->|Agent Pricing| PR[Unit: Pricing Requested\nnext: Agent Pricing]
    PR --> PP[Unit: Price Proposed\npricing basis + proposed price]
    PP --> PD{Owner decision}
    PD -->|Accept / set price| DP
    PD -->|Re-price| PR
    PD -->|Decline| WD([Unit: Withdrawn])
    DP --> G{Private proof + Owner ID +\nagreement + applicable price pass gate?}
    G -->|No| DP
    G -->|Yes| LI[Unit: Listed\nvisible to new Buyer matching]
    LI --> V[Auto-plan Unit Availability Verification\nEvent at listed date + 3 months]
    V --> DUE[Scheduler: Verification Due]
    DUE --> AV{Agent records Owner result}
    AV -->|Still Available| LI
    AV -->|Temporarily unavailable| OM[Unit: Off Market\nfuture verification action]
    AV -->|Re-price| PR
    AV -->|Withdrawn / sold elsewhere| WD
    OM -->|Owner confirms available| LI

    B[Buyer Owner Meeting / Showing] -.projects Event and Unit row.-> L
    BUY[Buyer Interest: Negotiating / Closing / Signed] -.refreshes Owner rollup only.-> LI
